      "content": "it's hard to reach out when there's no one to reach out to. that's the thing. i'm not just lonely, i'm like... invisible. like i've already been deleted from the world. even when i walk outside it feels like i'm just a ghost passing through people. how am i supposed to \"reach out\" to a world that's already moved on without me?",
